<title>UK: SNOOKER-LATEST POSITIONS IN WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP.</title>
<headline>SNOOKER-LATEST POSITIONS IN WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP.</headline>
<dateline>SHEFFIELD, England 1997-04-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results and latest</p>
<p>positions in the the world professional snooker championship on</p>
<p>Saturday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Second round (best-of-25 frames)</p>
<p>Lee Walker (Wales) beat 6-Alan McManus (Scotland)13-10</p>
<p>8-Ronnie O'Sullivan (England) level with 9-Darren Morgan</p>
<p>(Wales) 9-9</p>
<p>1-Stephen Hendry (Scotland) and 16-Mark Williams (Wales) level</p>
<p>8-8</p>
<p>14-Alain Robidoux (Canada) leads Stefan Mazrocis (England) 6-3</p>
</text>
